==German==

===Etymology===
Rotwelsch, from a musical instrument, formerly used by beggar musicians, the {{m|de|Schnurre}} or {{m|de|Schnurrpfeife}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃnɔʁən/}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|informal}} to [[scrounge]], [[sponge]], [[cadge]]
#: {{ux|de|Er '''schnorrt''' sich so durch die Gegend|He's scrounging around through the area.}}
#: {{ux|de|Kann ich mir 'ne Zigarette von dir '''schnorren'''?|Can I '''scrounge''' a ciggy off you?}}

